label Greeting
label CollectionIntro
if {Global_TallyRemaining} <= 0:
	jump SealedIntro
if {Global_MayariMet} == false:
	jump DebutIntro
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Global_LedgerTier} >= 4.0:
	# Tier 4 (75-99%): Near-sealed, openly in the player's corner while acting stern
	if {Variation} == 1.0:
		ReynaMayari: Only [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos left on Lola's Silver Ledger.
		ReynaMayari: Biringan's Council has stopped betting against you. Frankly, I am enjoying their silence. Minimum is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
	elif {Variation} == 2.0:
		ReynaMayari: The final stretch, shopkeeper. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain, and I expect you across the finish line.
		ReynaMayari: Offer at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos, and let us draw something generous.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: Almost sealed. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos left, though I will miss having an official excuse to drop by.
		ReynaMayari: Clear your throat? I said nothing. Minimum is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
elif {Global_LedgerTier} >= 3.0:
	# Tier 3 (50-74%): Halfway, rigging the deck while acting regal
	if {Variation} == 1.0:
		ReynaMayari: Past the halfway mark. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain on the ledger.
		ReynaMayari: The Council asked why your Moon Cards keep rolling gold. I told them to mind their own spires. Minimum [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
	elif {Variation} == 2.0:
		ReynaMayari: Your shelves look fuller every shift. Do not let that praise go to your head.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos left of [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyGoal}[/color]. Enough waiting. Place at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos on the wood, lest you'd rather face the Council.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: Half the silver recorded in Biringan, and your candy jar is still well-stocked. Good.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos to go. Minimum is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
elif {Global_LedgerTier} >= 2.0:
	# Tier 2 (30-49%): Daylight Audience unlocked (deadpan denial of daytime candy runs)
	if {Variation} == 1.0:
		ReynaMayari: Strictly Silver Ledger business right now. Do not mention the candies I bought earlier.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. I expect at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
	elif {Variation} == 2.0:
		ReynaMayari: I noticed you restocked the sweet jar on the top shelf. Completely irrelevant to our audit, of course.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos left on Lola's ledger. Minimum is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: Wipe that grin off your face, shopkeeper. Any resemblance to "Maria" is pure coincidence.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] of [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyGoal}[/color] pesos remain. Set at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos down.
elif {Global_LedgerTier} >= 1.0:
	# Tier 1 (15-29%): First seal broken, secretly impressed
	if {Variation} == 1.0:
		ReynaMayari: The first seal broke cleanly. You are far steadier than my court predicted.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. Minimum is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos, and use your reroll wisely.
	elif {Variation} == 2.0:
		ReynaMayari: Word travels fast past the balete tree. Half of Biringan expected you to fold by now. I knew better.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos left. Set at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos down.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: Still standing behind the wood, shopkeeper. Good. Keep proving my Council wrong.
		ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. At least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos, then draw your Moon Card.
else:
	# Tier 0 (0-14%): Early, brisk and regal
	if {Variation} == 1.0:
		ReynaMayari: Shutters closed, coins ready. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] of [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyGoal}[/color] pesos remain.
		ReynaMayari: I expect at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos.
	elif {Variation} == 2.0:
		ReynaMayari: The Silver Ledger is open. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain on Lola's pact.
		ReynaMayari: Offer at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos, then face the Moon Cards.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: Count carefully, shopkeeper. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos still stand on the ledger.
		ReynaMayari: Minimum is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos. Decide your share.
[signal arg="open_tally_offer"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label DebutIntro
ReynaMayari: The candle by the counter is missing. Your Lola never forgot it once.
- Who are you?
	ReynaMayari: Reyna Mayari, Queen of Biringan. And you hold your grandmother's counter.
- Are you a late customer?
	ReynaMayari: Bold guess for a mortal. I am Mayari, Queen of Biringan.
- You knew my Lola?
	ReynaMayari: Better than most in Karimlan. I am Mayari of Biringan.
ReynaMayari: Your Lola signed a Silver Ledger with my city. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyGoal}[/color] pesos remain to seal it.
ReynaMayari: Each shift you pay, the moon answers with Favors for generosity, or Omens if you fall short.
ReynaMayari: Even a sharp shopkeeper can turn an Omen into profit. Enough waiting. Place at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos on the wood.
[signal arg="open_tally_offer"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label SealedIntro
set {Variation} = range(1,5).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ReynaMayari: No coins owed, Patron. Keep your register closed and pick a lunar Favor instead.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: The Silver Ledger rests sealed in Biringan, yet I still drop by to bless your shelves.
elif {Variation} == 3.0:
	ReynaMayari: Keep your earnings, shopkeeper. Let us simply pick which Favor watches over your counter next.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Lola's pact is settled in full. Draw your Moon Card before you lock up.
[signal arg="open_tally_offer"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label Generous
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ReynaMayari: [color=#9a630a]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos. More than I asked, and only [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] left on the ledger.
	ReynaMayari: Do not look so smug. I am only smiling because the arithmetic is tidy. Enjoy your Favor.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Generous coin, shopkeeper. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain.
	ReynaMayari: Keep that pace up and I can watch Biringan's stuffiest elders eat their words.
else:
	ReynaMayari: [color=#9a630a]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos recorded in silver. Only [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] left.
	ReynaMayari: Your Lola used to slide extra coins over with that exact same grin. Take a good Favor tonight.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Success
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ReynaMayari: [color=#9a630a]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos recorded cleanly. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain.
	ReynaMayari: Steady work, shopkeeper. Drink some water before you lock up. That is a royal decree, not concern.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Fair coin, shopkeeper. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos left on Lola's ledger.
	ReynaMayari: Keep your chin up and your candy jars stocked, and you will clear this pact yet.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Exact and orderly. [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain before the pact seals.
	ReynaMayari: Not bad at all for a mortal counter.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Shortfall
label Angry
if {Global_TallyOffer} <= 0:
	ReynaMayari: Zero pesos on the wood? [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos still stand unpaid.
	ReynaMayari: Protocol forces my hand on an Omen, shopkeeper. Stock smart and bounce back next shift, understood?
else:
	ReynaMayari: Only [color=#9a630a]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos. Short of the mark, with [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] remaining.
	ReynaMayari: An Omen follows a light ledger, though a sharp shopkeeper can still squeeze profit out of bad weather. Do not fold on me now.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label MilestoneAlso
ReynaMayari: Oh, and do not lock the shutters just yet.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_reroll_1
ReynaMayari: You broke the first seal, [color=#9a630a]Moon's Grace[/color].
ReynaMayari: Strictly under an obscure royal clerical clause, I am granting you one free [color=#9a630a]reroll[/color] every night, and a cool evening breeze over your counter so dusk regulars tip [color=#9a630a]10% more often[/color] after five.
ReynaMayari: Watching a bad draw ruin a good shopkeeper's shift irritates me. Use it well.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_smugglers_cut
ReynaMayari: Twenty percent recorded. You have earned [color=#9a630a]Biringan Smuggler's Cut[/color].
ReynaMayari: My court's river barges share roads with your wholesale suppliers. Your restock orders are permanently [color=#9a630a]8% cheaper[/color], and I slipped a [color=#9a630a]100-peso trade rebate[/color] into your register.
ReynaMayari: Do not ask which elder's tariff ledger I crossed out to arrange it.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_daytime_mayari
ReynaMayari: Thirty percent settled. You have unlocked [color=#9a630a]Daylight Audience[/color].
ReynaMayari: Expect me during business hours in plainclothes, with a [color=#9a630a]35-peso royal tip[/color] whenever your shelves have what I want. Strictly to audit mortal commerce, obviously.
ReynaMayari: Keep that sweet candy jar full, and if you call me Your Majesty in front of neighbors, I will deny everything.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_lunar_margin
ReynaMayari: Nearly halfway through Lola's pact. [color=#9a630a]Lunar Patronage[/color] now rests on your wood.
ReynaMayari: Word of my favor has reached the street. Every item you sell carries a permanent [color=#9a630a]+12% Lunar Sale Bonus[/color], and neighbors settle their [color=#9a630a]lista tabs 20% more reliably[/color].
ReynaMayari: Turns out mortals pay their debts much faster when a moon goddess shops at the same counter.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_shifted_odds_reroll_2
ReynaMayari: Sixty percent of the Silver Ledger paid. [color=#9a630a]Silver Favor[/color] is yours.
ReynaMayari: Listen closely. I stacked the lunar deck toward Favors, slipped a [color=#9a630a]second reroll[/color] under the table, and your standing with every neighbor now climbs [color=#9a630a]15% faster[/color].
ReynaMayari: If Biringan's Council asks, the moon tilted on its own. Keep winning, shopkeeper.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_rare_moon_odds
ReynaMayari: Over seventy percent settled. You have earned the [color=#9a630a]Gilded Crescent[/color].
ReynaMayari: I unlocked Biringan's upper vault: [color=#9a630a]rarer Moon Cards[/color] appear far more often, Lavish tributes guarantee a [color=#9a630a]Rare Favor[/color], and my artisans cut [color=#9a630a]10% off every Store Upgrade[/color].
ReynaMayari: Consider it a thank-you for keeping my favorite snacks stocked. Not that a Queen plays favorites.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_twin_moons
ReynaMayari: Eighty-five percent honored. [color=#9a630a]Twin Moons[/color] is awake.
ReynaMayari: Take up to [color=#9a630a]two Moon Cards[/color] every night from now on, and whenever you dare pair a Favor with an Omen, my treasury will drop a [color=#9a630a]150-peso bounty[/color] on your counter at dawn.
ReynaMayari: My Council called it outrageous favoritism. I told them to audit me themselves.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label LedgerCleared
ReynaMayari: Every last peso on Lola's Silver Ledger, settled in full.
if {Global_CompletedNeighborsCount} >= 6.0:
	ReynaMayari: And look outside your awning. Half of Karimlan is standing along this road to vouch for Lola's counter.
	if {Flag_KapQuitSmoking}:
		ReynaMayari: The giant under the acacia tossed his lighter and stood watch by your corner.
	if {Flag_AnaFlewAgain}:
		ReynaMayari: Your karinderya neighbor took to the sky again, and left warm adobo on your wood.
	if {Flag_BrahimTrueAlbularyo}:
		ReynaMayari: The young albularyo's brass bell and Grand Agimat hum straight through the mist.
	if {Flag_RosalynAtPeace}:
		ReynaMayari: Even the highway bend went quiet once that last candy errand was finished.
	if {Flag_SmkLivingEmblem}:
		ReynaMayari: A gilded rooster bowed by the creek so the whole street learned the Litao's name.
	if {Flag_PiloChampion}:
		ReynaMayari: An old duwende and a seven-foot tikbalang brought sipa back to the half-court.
	ReynaMayari: Biringan's Council cannot touch a street this alive. The Silver Pact is permanently sealed, friend.
elif {Global_CompletedNeighborsCount} >= 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: More than coin answered my ledger. A loyal circle of neighbors found warmth across your wood.
	if {Flag_KapQuitSmoking}:
		ReynaMayari: The giant under the acacia breathes easier because of this counter.
	if {Flag_BrahimTrueAlbularyo}:
		ReynaMayari: Your counter glows with a true albularyo's Grand Agimat.
	if {Flag_RosalynAtPeace}:
		ReynaMayari: Even the highway bend rests quietly now.
	ReynaMayari: The Silver Pact is sealed with honor. Keep your earnings from now on, shopkeeper.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Clean numbers, exact coin, not a centavo short. Though the bench outside stayed quiet.
	ReynaMayari: The Silver Pact is sealed by the letter of the law. Karimlan remains open beneath my watch.
[signal arg="show_epilogue"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label SealedOutro
set {Variation} = range(1,5).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ReynaMayari: Sealed in silver. Rest well, Patron.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Wise choice. Lock the shutters and get some sleep, shopkeeper.
elif {Variation} == 3.0:
	ReynaMayari: Done. Keep the candy jar full in case I drop by during business hours.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Your Favor is set. Lola would be grinning ear to ear right now.
[end_timeline]
